.TH COLDLINE 1 "2026-11-25" "coldline @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
coldline \- Coldline Backup Service: backup source and destination tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B coldline
[\fIglobal options\fR] \fIcommand\fR [\fIargs\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B coldline
is a shell-based backup tool. The same program runs on backup sources and
destinations; behavior is selected by configuration and command. Backups are
declared as a list of \fIbackup targets\fR in a YAML configuration file.
.PP
The project is in early design; only \fBhelp\fR and \fBversion\fR are implemented.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B help
Show usage.
.TP
.B version
Show version.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " \fIFILE\fR"
Configuration file. Default \fI/etc/coldline/coldline.yaml\fR.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Increase verbosity (repeatable).
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Only print errors.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B COLDLINE_CONFIG
Configuration file path.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable colored output.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/coldline/coldline.yaml
Main configuration.
.TP
.I /etc/coldline/conf.d/*.yaml
Configuration drop-ins (lexical order).
.TP
.I /var/lib/coldline/
State.
.TP
.I /run/coldline/
Runtime files and locks.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Follows
.BR sysexits (3):
0 success, 64 usage error, 69 unavailable, 70 internal error, 78 configuration error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ssh (1),
.BR rsync (1),
.BR systemd.timer (5)
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/joeygrasso/coldline-backup-service/issues
